    "schoolSystemOverview": "In Baltimore and across the United States, school support for neurodivergent learners is primarily structured under federal frameworks: Individualized Education Programs (IEPs) under IDEA and Section 504 Accommodation Plans. Parents frequently navigate Student Study Team (SST) meetings, comprehensive psychoeducational evaluations, and specialized classroom placements. Online parent consultation helps you understand clinical testing metrics, prioritize requested accommodations, and maintain collaborative dialogue with teachers and school psychologists.",
