    "assessmentWaitingSupport": "While on waiting lists for developmental assessments in Baltimore, families can make significant progress at home. You can document specific behavioral triggers across different settings, maintain consistent daily sleep and nutrition routines, request objective observations from classroom teachers, and implement positive, proactive co-regulation strategies to support emotional well-being.",
