    "schoolSystemOverview": "In London Ontario and across Canada, provincial ministries of education provide Individual Education Plans (IEPs) and Identification, Placement, and Review Committee (IPRC) frameworks. Schools collaborate with multidisciplinary resource teachers to implement classroom accommodations and modified curriculums. Parent consultation assists families in interpreting school psychoeducational evaluations and establishing cohesive home-school routines.",
