    "multilingualFamilyContext": "Many households in Vaughan navigate multilingual environments (including English and English). Research confirms that multilingualism does not cause speech delay, autism, or ADHD. Our guidance helps parents foster rich, communicative home environments that honour and nurture all the languages spoken in the family.",
    "schoolSystemOverview": "In Vaughan and across Canada, provincial ministries of education provide Individual Education Plans (IEPs) and Identification, Placement, and Review Committee (IPRC) frameworks. Schools collaborate with multidisciplinary resource teachers to implement classroom accommodations and modified curriculums. Parent consultation assists families in interpreting school psychoeducational evaluations and establishing cohesive home-school routines.",
