    "schoolSystemOverview": "In Gujranwala and throughout Pakistan, education spans provincial public institutions, semi-private networks, and private Cambridge/international schools. While formal special education legislation is evolving, many schools offer specialized learning-support coordinators and individualized accommodations. Online parent guidance helps parents communicate constructively with educators, structure homework expectations, and create clear collaborative plans.",
