    "schoolSystemOverview": "In Malmo and across Sweden, education systems provide inclusive learning support and specialized pedagogical accommodations for children with learning differences and attention needs. Whether attending international baccalaureate (IB), national bilingual, or local community schools, our consultations help parents understand school reports and collaborate productively with learning-support teams.",
